<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>YENZE | Sales Landing Page Generator</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Generate high-converting sales landing pages with Google Stitch.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Outfit:wght@500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-body: #FAFAFA;
            --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
            --text-main: #18181B;
            --text-muted: #71717A;
            --accent: #18181B;
            --accent-hover: #000000;
            --border: #E4E4E7;
            --border-active: #18181B;
            --ring-focus: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.1);
            --shadow-soft: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            --shadow-hover: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025);
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --font-display: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background: var(--bg-body);
            color: var(--text-main);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding-bottom: 80px;
        }

        /* Navbar */
        .navbar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            height: 64px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 10%;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .fab-generate {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 32px;
            right: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            border-radius: 100px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .fab-generate:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
        }

        .fab-generate.copied {
            background: #059669;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: #f4f4f5;
        }

        .nav-link.primary {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
        }

        .nav-link.primary:hover {
            background: var(--accent-hover);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Main Layout */
        .main {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 52px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 50%, #EC4899 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* How it Works */
        .how-it-works {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
        }

        .step-pill {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            background: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 100px;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-main);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .step-pill:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            border-color: #6366F1;
        }

        .step-num {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 100%);
            color: white;
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Sections */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .section-label {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* Option Cards */
        .options-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .option {
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 24px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            gap: 12px;
            min-height: 120px;
        }

        .option:hover {
            border-color: #a1a1aa;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        }

        .option.selected {
            border-color: #6366F1 !important;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05) 100%) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1) !important;
        }

        .option-icon {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 0;
            display: block;
        }

        .option.selected .option-icon {
            color: #6366F1;
        }

        .option-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        /* Inputs */
        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        input:focus,
        textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #6366F1;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Output Terminal */
        .output-section {
            background: #09090b;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            margin-top: 64px;
            border: 1px solid #27272a;
        }

        .output-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%);
            padding: 20px 28px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #4338ca;
        }

        .output-title {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            color: #e4e4e7;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .output-content {
            padding: 32px;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #d4d4d8;
            line-height: 1.8;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            max-height: 500px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .copy-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        /* Actions */
        .actions {
            margin-top: 48px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .btn {
            height: 60px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: white;
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: #a1a1aa;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Workflow Guide */
        .workflow-guide {
            margin-top: 64px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .guide-title {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .guide-steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .guide-step {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .guide-icon {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .guide-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .guide-text strong {
            display: block;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .how-it-works {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .options-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .guide-steps {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .actions {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav-links .nav-link:not(.primary) {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon>
                <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            YENZE
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="https://builder.yenze.io/dashboard.html" class="nav-link">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="https://builder.yenze.io" class="nav-link primary">Open Builder</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="main">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Sales Landing Page Generator</h1>
            <p>Create high-converting sales landing pages that turn visitors into customers with Google Stitch AI.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- How it works -->
        <div class="how-it-works">
            <div class="step-pill">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <span>Configure Goal</span>
            </div>
            <div class="step-pill">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <span>Generate Prompt</span>
            </div>
            <div class="step-pill">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <span>Create & Launch</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Landing Page Goal -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">1. Landing Page Goal</div>
            <div class="options-grid" id="goalOptions">
                <div class="option" data-value="product-launch">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Product Launch</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="lead-gen">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnet option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Lead Generation</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="saas-signup">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">SaaS Sign-Up</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="course-sales">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Course Sales</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="event-registration">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Event Registration</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="waitlist">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clock option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Waitlist/Pre-Launch</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="ecommerce">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">E-commerce Product</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="consultation">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Book Consultation</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Conversion Strategy -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">2. Conversion Strategy</div>
            <div class="options-grid" id="strategyOptions">
                <div class="option" data-value="urgency">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-fire option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Urgency & Scarcity</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="social-proof">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-users option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Social Proof Heavy</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="benefit-driven">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Benefit-Driven</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="problem-solution">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Problem-Solution</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="comparison">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Before/After Comparison</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="value-stack">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Value Stack</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Design Style -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">3. Visual Style</div>
            <div class="options-grid" id="styleOptions">
                <div class="option" data-value="minimal">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Clean Minimal</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="bold">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-square-full option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Bold & Vibrant</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="professional">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Professional Corporate</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="modern">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Modern Tech</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="luxury">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gem option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Luxury Premium</span>
                </div>
                <div class="option" data-value="playful">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-smile option-icon"></i>
                    <span class="option-label">Friendly & Playful</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Product/Service Details -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">4. Product/Service Details</div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
                <div>
                    <label>Product/Service Name</label>
                    <input type="text" id="productName" placeholder="e.g., ProFlow CRM, Master Photography Course...">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Main Value Proposition (What problem does it solve?)</label>
                    <textarea id="valueProposition" style="min-height: 100px;"
                        placeholder="e.g., Automate your sales pipeline and close 3x more deals in half the time..."></textarea>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Target Audience</label>
                    <input type="text" id="targetAudience"
                        placeholder="e.g., Small business owners, Marketing agencies, Entrepreneurs...">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Price Point (if applicable)</label>
                    <input type="text" id="price" placeholder="e.g., $49/month, $997 one-time, Free trial...">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Key Benefits (comma-separated)</label>
                    <textarea id="benefits" style="min-height: 80px;"
                        placeholder="e.g., Save 10 hours per week, Increase conversions by 40%, 24/7 customer support..."></textarea>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Call-to-Action Text</label>
                    <input type="text" id="ctaText" placeholder="e.g., Start Free Trial, Get Instant Access, Book Your Spot...">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Output -->
        <div class="output-section">
            <div class="output-header">
                <span class="output-title">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i>
                    SALES_LANDING_PROMPT
                </span>
                <button class="copy-btn" id="copyBtn">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-clone"></i> Copy Prompt
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="output-content" id="output">
// Configure your landing page settings above to generate your optimized prompt...
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Actions -->
        <div class="actions">
            <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Open Google Stitch
            </a>
            <a href="builder.html" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Go to Builder
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Workflow Guide -->
        <div class="workflow-guide">
            <h3 class="guide-title">How to Create Your Sales Landing Page</h3>
            <div class="guide-steps">
                <div class="guide-step">
                    <div class="guide-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i></div>
                    <div class="guide-text">
                        <strong>1. Configure</strong>
                        Select your goal, strategy, and fill in your product details above.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="guide-step">
                    <div class="guide-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i></div>
                    <div class="guide-text">
                        <strong>2. Generate</strong>
                        Copy the optimized prompt and paste it into Google Stitch to generate your landing page.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="guide-step">
                    <div class="guide-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i></div>
                    <div class="guide-text">
                        <strong>3. Launch</strong>
                        Import the generated HTML to YENZE Builder, customize, and publish your high-converting page.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height: 60px;"></div>

    </main>

    <!-- Floating Action Button -->
    <button class="fab-generate" id="actionCopyBtn">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i>
        Copy Prompt
    </button>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const state = {
                goal: '',
                strategy: '',
                style: '',
                productName: '',
                valueProposition: '',
                targetAudience: '',
                price: '',
                benefits: '',
                ctaText: ''
            };

            // Goal options
            document.querySelectorAll('#goalOptions .option').forEach(el => {
                el.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    document.querySelectorAll('#goalOptions .option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('selected'));
                    el.classList.add('selected');
                    state.goal = el.dataset.value;
                    updatePrompt();
                });
            });

            // Strategy options
            document.querySelectorAll('#strategyOptions .option').forEach(el => {
                el.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    document.querySelectorAll('#strategyOptions .option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('selected'));
                    el.classList.add('selected');
                    state.strategy = el.dataset.value;
                    updatePrompt();
                });
            });

            // Style options
            document.querySelectorAll('#styleOptions .option').forEach(el => {
                el.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    document.querySelectorAll('#styleOptions .option').forEach(o => o.classList.remove('selected'));
                    el.classList.add('selected');
                    state.style = el.dataset.value;
                    updatePrompt();
                });
            });

            // Text inputs
            ['productName', 'valueProposition', 'targetAudience', 'price', 'benefits', 'ctaText'].forEach(field => {
                document.getElementById(field).addEventListener('input', (e) => {
                    state[field] = e.target.value;
                    updatePrompt();
                });
            });

            // Copy button
            document.getElementById('copyBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                const text = document.getElementById('output').textContent;
                if (text.includes('// Configure')) {
                    alert('Please configure your landing page settings first');
                    return;
                }
                navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
                    const btn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
                    const originalContent = btn.innerHTML;
                    btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Copied!';
                    setTimeout(() => {
                        btn.innerHTML = originalContent;
                    }, 2000);
                });
            });

            // FAB Copy button
            document.getElementById('actionCopyBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                document.getElementById('copyBtn').click();
                const fab = document.getElementById('actionCopyBtn');
                const originalText = fab.innerHTML;
                fab.innerHTML = '<i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Copied!';
                fab.classList.add('copied');
                setTimeout(() => {
                    fab.innerHTML = originalText;
                    fab.classList.remove('copied');
                }, 2000);
            });

            function updatePrompt() {
                // Check if minimum required fields are filled
                if (!state.goal && !state.productName && !state.valueProposition) {
                    document.getElementById('output').textContent = '// Configure your landing page settings above to generate your optimized prompt...';
                    return;
                }

                const goalDescriptions = {
                'product-launch': 'New Product Launch - Create excitement and drive early adopters',
                'lead-gen': 'Lead Generation - Capture qualified leads with irresistible offer',
                'saas-signup': 'SaaS Free Trial/Demo - Convert visitors to active users',
                'course-sales': 'Online Course Sales - Sell educational products with authority',
                'event-registration': 'Event Registration - Fill seats for webinars/conferences',
                'waitlist': 'Waitlist/Pre-Launch - Build anticipation and early interest',
                'ecommerce': 'E-commerce Product - Direct product sales with cart integration',
                'consultation': 'Book Consultation - Schedule high-ticket sales calls'
            };

            const strategyDescriptions = {
                'urgency': 'LIMITED TIME ONLY - Countdown timers, scarcity indicators, FOMO triggers',
                'social-proof': 'TRUST AMPLIFICATION - Testimonials, case studies, client logos, review ratings',
                'benefit-driven': 'BENEFITS SHOWCASE - Feature cards with clear ROI, transformation outcomes',
                'problem-solution': 'PAIN-AGITATE-SOLVE - Start with pain points, agitate, then present solution',
                'comparison': 'BEFORE/AFTER - Visual transformations, comparison tables, success metrics',
                'value-stack': 'VALUE STACKING - Show total value vs price, bonuses, packages'
            };

            const styleDescriptions = {
                'minimal': 'Clean Minimal - Swiss design, lots of white space, Helvetica-style, subtle shadows',
                'bold': 'Bold & Vibrant - High contrast, bright colors, oversized typography, energetic',
                'professional': 'Professional Corporate - Trust-building, corporate blues, structured layout',
                'modern': 'Modern Tech - Glassmorphism, gradients, smooth animations, futuristic',
                'luxury': 'Luxury Premium - Serif fonts, gold accents, elegant spacing, sophisticated',
                'playful': 'Friendly & Playful - Rounded corners, warm colors, approachable, fun illustrations'
            };

            const prompt = `Create a high-converting sales landing page with the following specifications:

**IMPORTANT FOR GOOGLE STITCH**: Generate a complete, self-contained HTML page in a single file with embedded CSS and JavaScript.

---

### 🎯 LANDING PAGE MISSION
**Goal**: ${goalDescriptions[state.goal] || 'High-Converting Sales Landing Page'}
**Conversion Strategy**: ${strategyDescriptions[state.strategy] || 'Multi-layered conversion approach'}
**Visual Style**: ${styleDescriptions[state.style] || 'Modern professional design'}

---

### 📦 PRODUCT/SERVICE DETAILS
**Product Name**: ${state.productName || '[Your Product Name]'}
**Value Proposition**: ${state.valueProposition || '[Main value proposition - what problem you solve]'}
**Target Audience**: ${state.targetAudience || '[Your ideal customer]'}
**Price Point**: ${state.price || '[Pricing information]'}
**Key Benefits**: ${state.benefits || '[List your key benefits]'}
**Call-to-Action**: "${state.ctaText || 'Get Started Now'}"

---

### 🎨 DESIGN SYSTEM (MANDATORY)

**Layout Requirements**:
- Single-page, long-scroll format optimized for conversions
- Full-width hero section (100vh) with compelling headline and CTA above the fold
- Sticky navigation with CTA button always visible
- Mobile-first responsive design with hamburger menu < 768px
- Maximum content width: 1280px with proper centering

**Typography System**:
\`\`\`css
:root {
    --font-heading: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; }
h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; }
h3 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; }
body { font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; }
\`\`\`

**Color Scheme** (adjust based on visual style):
\`\`\`css
:root {
    --primary: #6366F1;
    --primary-dark: #4F46E5;
    --secondary: #8B5CF6;
    --success: #10B981;
    --warning: #F59E0B;
    --bg-main: #FFFFFF;
    --bg-secondary: #F9FAFB;
    --text-main: #111827;
    --text-muted: #6B7280;
    --border: #E5E7EB;
}
\`\`\`

---

### 📋 LANDING PAGE STRUCTURE (ORDERED SECTIONS)

1. **HERO SECTION** (Full-height, above the fold)
   - Compelling headline that hooks immediately (use value proposition)
   - Subheadline expanding on the benefit
   - PRIMARY CTA button (large, prominent, ${state.ctaText || 'Get Started Now'})
   - Hero image/video (use https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/[relevant-description]?width=1200&height=800&nologo=true)
   - Trust indicators (e.g., "Join 10,000+ users" or "★★★★★ 4.9/5 rating")

2. **SOCIAL PROOF BAR**
   - Client logos or "As seen on" badges (use grayscale filter for uniformity)
   - Or: Achievement numbers (users, revenue, growth stats)

3. **PROBLEM/PAIN SECTION**
   - Start with "Are you struggling with..." or "Tired of..."
   - List 3-5 major pain points your audience experiences
   - Use icons and bold text for each pain point

4. **SOLUTION INTRODUCTION**
   - Introduce your product as THE solution
   - 2-3 sentences max, benefit-focused
   - Visual: Product screenshot or mockup

5. **BENEFITS/FEATURES GRID**
   - 3-6 benefit cards in responsive grid
   - Each card: Icon + Headline + 1-2 sentence description
   - Focus on OUTCOMES not features ("Save 10 hours per week" not "Automation tools")

6. **HOW IT WORKS** (Optional for complex products)
   - 3-step process showing simplicity
   - Step 1 → Step 2 → Step 3 with arrows
   - Each step: Number badge + Headline + Description

7. **TESTIMONIALS/CASE STUDIES**
   ${state.strategy === 'social-proof' ? `
   ⭐ EXTRA EMPHASIS ON SOCIAL PROOF:
   - Minimum 6 testimonials with photos and full names
   - Include specific results/numbers ("Increased revenue by 145%")
   - Add company logos if B2B
   - Star ratings (★★★★★) prominently displayed
   ` : ''}
   - 3-6 customer testimonials in card layout
   - Each testimonial: Photo + Name + Title/Company + Quote + Rating
   - Use real-looking placeholder images from Pollinations AI

8. **PRICING/OFFER SECTION**
   ${state.strategy === 'value-stack' ? `
   ⭐ VALUE STACK APPROACH:
   - Show itemized value breakdown (Each feature worth $X)
   - Total value: $XXX
   - Your price: $XX (70%+ savings)
   - Display savings in green/highlight
   ` : ''}
   - Clear pricing display with ${state.price || 'your price'}
   - Highlight best value/most popular plan if multiple tiers
   - List what's included (features with checkmarks ✓)
   - Money-back guarantee badge if applicable
   - PRIMARY CTA button

9. **FAQ SECTION**
   - Accordion-style expandable questions
   - Address top 5-7 objections/concerns
   - Smooth animations on expand/collapse

10. **FINAL CTA SECTION**
    - Restate main benefit
    - Last chance CTA (${state.ctaText || 'Get Started Now'})
    ${state.strategy === 'urgency' ? `
    ⭐ URGENCY ELEMENTS:
    - Countdown timer (JavaScript)
    - "Only X spots left" or "Offer ends soon"
    - Red/orange urgency colors
    - Flashing or pulsing CTA button
    ` : ''}
    - Risk reversal statement ("No credit card required", "Cancel anytime", etc.)

11. **FOOTER**
    - Simple footer with links, copyright, social media icons

---

### 🎯 CONVERSION OPTIMIZATION (CRITICAL)

**CTA Buttons**:
- PRIMARY CTA appears minimum 3 times (hero, pricing, final)
- Button style: \`padding: 18px 48px; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 12px;\`
- Hover effect: \`transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\`
- Use action verbs in CTA text
- Add subtle pulse animation to primary CTAs

**Trust Elements Throughout**:
- Security badges (SSL, payment icons if e-commerce)
- Guarantee seals
- Media mentions/awards
- Customer count/stats

**Psychological Triggers**:
${state.strategy === 'urgency' ? '- URGENCY: Countdown timers, limited availability, expiring offers' : ''}
${state.strategy === 'social-proof' ? '- SOCIAL PROOF: Testimonials, reviews, user counts, celebrity endorsements' : ''}
${state.strategy === 'comparison' ? '- CONTRAST: Before/after images, comparison tables, transformation stories' : ''}
- RECIPROCITY: Free resources, trial offers, bonuses
- AUTHORITY: Credentials, certifications, expert endorsements

**Smooth Scroll Animations**:
- Use IntersectionObserver API for scroll-triggered animations
- Fade-in + slide-up effect for sections as they enter viewport
- Stagger animations for grid items (delay: 100ms, 200ms, 300ms)

---

### 💻 TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS

**Single File Output**:
- Complete HTML with embedded \`<style>\` and \`<script>\` tags
- Include FontAwesome CDN: \`<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">\`

**Form Integration** (if lead-gen or consultation):
\`\`\`html
<form id="leadForm" onsubmit="handleFormSubmit(event)">
  <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Full Name" required>
  <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
  <button type="submit">Submit</button>
</form>

<script>
async function handleFormSubmit(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const btn = e.target.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
    btn.innerHTML = '<i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Submitting...';
    btn.disabled = true;

    const formData = new FormData(e.target);
    const data = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());

    try {
        const res = await fetch('https://yenze.io/api/submit-form', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},
            body: JSON.stringify(data)
        });
        if(res.ok) {
            alert('Success! Check your email.');
            e.target.reset();
        } else {
            alert('Error submitting form');
        }
    } catch(err) {
        alert('Network error');
    } finally {
        btn.innerHTML = 'Submit';
        btn.disabled = false;
    }
}
</script>
\`\`\`

**Images**:
- Use Pollinations AI: \`https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/[description]?width=X&height=Y&nologo=true\`
- Examples:
  - Hero: \`/prompt/modern%20professional%20working%20on%20laptop?width=1200&height=800&nologo=true\`
  - Testimonials: \`/prompt/professional%20headshot%20portrait?width=200&height=200&nologo=true\`
- ALWAYS include descriptive \`alt\` attributes for SEO

**Performance**:
- Lazy load images below the fold: \`loading="lazy"\`
- Minimize JavaScript, prefer CSS animations
- Use CSS custom properties (variables) for easy theming

